<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan flour group to tender for 69,000T US wheat.</title>
<headline>Taiwan flour group to tender for 69,000T US wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Flour Mills Association would tender on Thursday for two shipments totalling 69,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, Taipei traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The first shipment would be slated for March 15 to April 5 delivery from the Pacific Northwest, the second shipment would be slated for March 31 to April 20 from the Pacific Northwest, traders said.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p> Type			 Tonnage</p>
<p>Shipment One</p>
<p>Dark Northern Spring   19,100</p>
<p>Hard Red Winter	   9,100</p>
<p>White Wheat		 6,800</p>
<p> Type			 Tonnage</p>
<p>Shipment Two</p>
<p>Dark Northern Spring   18,000</p>
<p>Hard Red Winter	   9,400</p>
<p>White Wheat		 6,600</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
